# An XR headset: the view turns and comes back, the panel's own controls minimise the app and its menu answers.
open!
wait id=title 30
xr look 30
xr look -30,10
xr recenter
xr panel menu
wait id=tidy_up_button 5
xr panel tidy
expect id=title
xr panel minimize
wait gone id=title 10
open
wait id=title 20
